  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FORWARD THINKING PEACE BUILDING ISRAEL/PALESTINE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is titled Exchanging insights between divided societies: Developing policing and security and the voices of women in conflict. The project is intended to operate in two strands, the first to draw on the process of police reform in Northern Ireland, and the second to focus on empowering the voices of Israeli and Palestinian women, aimed at learning from the experiences in Ireland and Northern Ireland of women&#x2019;s caucuses. The recommended funding amount for this project is &#x20ac;70,000. The projects is similar to previous projects which have been funded since 2016. Forward Thinking is an NGO with 17 years&#x2019; experience in conflict mediation, prevention, resolution and political dialogue in the MENA region.</narrative>
  </description>
